WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:24.384
First, here is Forth Lighting as a customer sees it on a phone today.

2
00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:28.818
It is a good store, with a catalogue of 181 products.

3
00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:30.734
But it lives in a browser tab.

4
00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:39.309
Every visit starts cold, with no icon on the home screen, no push notifications, and nothing to bring a customer back once they leave.

5
00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:41.737
Now, the same store as an app.

6
00:00:41.737 --> 00:00:46.126
It already uses your logo, your colours and your real products.

7
00:00:46.126 --> 00:00:49.847
Here is the home screen, with your banners and best sellers.

8
00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:51.371
Browsing is fast.

9
00:00:51.371 --> 00:00:57.276
Search, filter and sort across your full catalogue of 181 products.

10
00:00:57.276 --> 00:01:03.692
Open a product and you get the gallery, the sizes and the price in rupees, straight from your Shopify data.

11
00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:07.997
Add it to the bag, and bundles suggest the matching piece to go with it.

12
00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:11.826
Then the bag and checkout, which is your own Shopify checkout.

13
00:01:11.826 --> 00:01:17.829
Your payment methods, your shipping rules and your orders all stay exactly where they are today.

14
00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:20.775
We also looked at what your store already runs.

15
00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:22.815
Judge.me for reviews.

16
00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:26.370
Those ratings show up inside the app on every product.

17
00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.327
Instafeed.

18
00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:30.350
Your Instagram feed gets its own place in the app.

19
00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.092
Hotjar and GA4 for analytics.

20
00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:36.200
App events flow into the reports you already read.

21
00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.730
Nothing gets replaced and nothing needs to be rebuilt.

22
00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.202
Here is how we work.

23
00:01:41.202 --> 00:01:45.587
We audit your store first, then give you one fixed quote for the build.

24
00:01:45.587 --> 00:01:47.742
There are no hourly surprises.

25
00:01:47.742 --> 00:01:53.089
After launch, the app belongs to you, and we only stay on if you want support.

